# Architecture — VTC Apps

Auth: `auth-bootstrap.mdc`. API layout: `api-routes.mdc`. App types: `app-types.mdc`.

## Two App Types

**Dedicated app** — Publish UI **Publisher** (CSV token `app`); one fixed publisher-space database; credentials at publish; always `connectDB()`; never SDK `getDb()`.

**Shared app** — tenanted DB per space when `group_id !== '0'`; SDK `getDb()` in production; localhost dev always `connectDB()`.

**Personal storage** — not a third `getDbWithAuth()` branch. Use SDK `personalDb()` (`@vtc/sdk` ≥ 1.4.0) for user-owned rows. Full rules: `personal-storage.mdc`.

```typescript
// src/lib/db.ts — Shared app
export async function getDbWithAuth(request: NextRequest) {
  const user = getAuthenticatedUser(request)
  if (!user) throw new Error('Authentication required')

  if (process.env.MONGODB_URI?.includes('localhost')) {
    return { db: await connectDB(user), user }
  }

  if (user.group_id && user.group_id !== '0') {
    return { db: await getDb(request), user }
  }

  return { db: await connectDB(user), user }
}

export async function getDbOptionalAuth(request: NextRequest) {
  try { return await getDbWithAuth(request) }
  catch { return { db: null, user: null } }
}
```

```typescript
// src/lib/db.ts — Dedicated app
export async function getDbWithAuth(request: NextRequest) {
  const user = getAuthenticatedUser(request)
  if (!user) throw new Error('Authentication required')
  return { db: await connectDB(user), user }
}
```

