## Role System

```typescript
// role_type: "1" = Owner, "2" = Admin, "3"+ = Member
import { isAdmin, isOwner } from '@/lib/auth'
if (!isAdmin(user)) {
  return NextResponse.json(
    { success: false, code: 'AUTH_403', error: 'Admin required' },
    { status: 403 }
  )
}
```

In-app ACL (member lists, space roles): `access-control.mdc`. Catalog visibility (Space/Network/Platform): shell only.

## URL Sharing (Via)

Shared URLs MUST include `?token=`. Via API uses `Authorization: Bearer` (platform service).

```typescript
const longUrl = addTokenToUrl(`https://yourapp.vtc.com/item/${itemId}`)
const response = await fetch('https://via.posif.com/api/shorten', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}`, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify({
    url: longUrl,
    appName: 'your-app',
    reference: `your-app-${itemId}-${user.group_id}`,
    expiresIn: 604800,
  }),
})
```

## Platform API (ZAPI)

Host: **`https://api.vtc.com`** via `VTC_API_URL` (`env-development.mdc`). Use `getVtcApiUrl()` — legacy `POSIF_API_URL` still injected in parallel.

- Shared app production: `getDb(request)` → `GET ${getVtcApiUrl()}/api/v1/db/` with `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>`
- JWT `group_id` loads space silo (`db_{groupId}_2`); auto-creates when missing
- Localhost dev: `connectDB(user)` with `db_{groupId}_2`

## Personal store

```typescript
import { personalDb } from '@vtc/sdk'

const store = personalDb(request) // or personalDb(request, token)
const col = store.collection('myapp_notes')
await col.insertOne({ title: 'hello', status: 'active' })
const rows = await col.find({ status: { $ne: 'deleted' } }, { limit: 50 })
```

Do **not** return `personalDb()` from `getDbWithAuth()`. Keep `getPersonalStore(request)` (or equivalent) separate. Never use `getPersonalDb()` for new app data.

## SDK Methods

```typescript
import sdk from '@vtc/sdk'
import { getVtcApiUrl } from '@/lib/env'

sdk.getUserInfo()
sdk.getGroupInfo()
sdk.getMembers(20, 0)
sdk.getGroups(20, 0, 'owner')
sdk.getNetworks(20, 0, 'member')
```

Pass `apiBaseUrl: getVtcApiUrl()` so SDK calls hit **api.vtc.com**.

